{
  "title": "Four Stages of Workflow Adoption",
  "notes": "Reconstruction of the 9/08 'four stages' clip deck: <style> block with custom properties, :nth-child card variants, pill tags, mono STAGE labels, ::before accent bar and empty meter spans. Clicking into a card flattened the whole slide.",
  "slides": [
