      "layout": "blank",
      "notes": "Four rungs; most teams we talk to are between stage one and two.",
      "content": "      <div class=\"fmd-slide stages\" style=\"padding: 40px 56px 28px; background: #0a0a0b; color: #fafafa; font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">\n        <style>\n  .stages { --teal: #22d3ee; --salmon: #fb923c; --mint: #34d399; }\n  .stages .eyebrow { font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--teal); }\n  .stages .title { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1; margin: 8px 0 8px; color: #fafafa; }\n  .stages .lede { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #a1a1aa; max-width: 640px; margin: 0; }\n  .stages .ladder { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 14px; align-items: end; margin-top: 18px; }\n  .stages .step { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .stages .tag { align-self: flex-start; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; }\n  .stages .tag.salmon { background: var(--salmon); color: #1c1917; }\n  .stages .tag.teal { background: var(--teal); color: #083344; }\n  .stages .tag.outline { border: 1px solid var(--mint); color: var(--mint); }\n  .stages .stem { width: 1px; height: 14px; margin-left: 12px; background: currentColor; opacity: 0.6; }\n  .stages .card { border: 1px solid #3f3f46; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 14px 16px; background: #111113; }\n  .stages .step:nth-child(1) .card { border-color: var(--salmon); min-height: 124px; }\n  .stages .step:nth-child(2) .card { border-color: var(--teal); min-height: 150px; }\n  .stages .step:nth-child(3) .card { border-color: var(--mint); min-height: 176px; }\n  .stages .step:nth-child(4) { opacity: 0.45; }\n  .stages .step:nth-child(4) .card { min-height: 202px; }\n  .stages .stage { font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #71717a; }\n  .stages .step:nth-child(2) .stage { color: var(--teal); }\n  .stages .step:nth-child(3) .stage { color: var(--mint); }\n  .stages .card h3 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; margin: 6px 0 8px; color: #fafafa; }\n  .stages .card p { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; color: #a1a1aa; margin: 0; }\n  .stages .scale { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #27272a; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #52525b; }\n  .stages .scale b { color: #d4d4d8; font-weight: 600; }\n  .stages .callout { position: relative; padding: 18px 22px 18px 26px; background: #111113; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; color: #fafafa; max-width: 700px; }\n  .stages .callout::before { content: \"\"; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 12px; bottom: 12px; width: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--teal); }\n  .stages .meter { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 26px; }\n  .stages .meter span { flex: 1; height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: #27272a; }\n  .stages .meter span.on { background: var(--teal); }\n  .stages .legend { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #71717a; }\n  .stages .legend .here { color: var(--teal); }\n</style>\n        <div class=\"eyebrow\">Workflow adoption</div>\n        <h1 class=\"title\">Four stages of workflow adoption</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Every team sits somewhere on this ladder. Moving up takes less time than you'd expect — and each rung changes what \"just one more automation\" means.</p>\n        <div class=\"ladder\">\n          <div class=\"step\">\n            <div class=\"tag salmon\">● Early curiosity</div>\n            <div class=\"stem\" style=\"color: #fb923c;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\">Stage 1</div><h3>Curiosity</h3><p>One person tries it on a side project, mostly to see what the fuss is about.</p></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"step\">\n            <div class=\"tag teal\">Daily habit · manageable</div>\n            <div class=\"stem\" style=\"color: #22d3ee;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\">Stage 2</div><h3>Routine</h3><p>It becomes part of the morning. Skipping it feels slow, but the team can still work without it.</p></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"step\">\n            <div class=\"tag outline\">Point of no return</div>\n            <div class=\"stem\" style=\"color: #34d399;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\">Stage 3</div><h3>Dependence</h3><p>Core work runs through it. Planning assumes it exists, and outages get noticed within minutes.</p></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"step\">\n            <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"stage\">Stage 4</div><h3>Devotion</h3><p>Templates, reviews and onboarding are built around it. It is no longer a tool; it is infrastructure.</p></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"scale\"><span><b>Adoption</b> · Low</span><span>Basic function →</span><span><b>Adoption</b> · Critical</span></div>\n      </div>"
    },
